# Machine manifests are instance data and live in the private instance;
# AGENTS_MACHINE_DIR points at them. examples/machine/ is the public template
# and is tracked in full, so a stranger can copy it into machine/ and run. The
# rule below is anchored: an unanchored `machine/` also swallowed
# scripts/lib/machine/, which is engine source.
/machine/
